  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-11-03T01:55:28.118Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If we switch control method from controller to hand tracking, the finger behavior is not synced with others and the hand is always in \"Idle\" state.\nRejoin, change avatars, etc. to reload the avatar, and the finger behavior becomes synced.\nSince Quest hand Tracking is supposed to be one of the main features of this OpenBeta, which is currently in RC, this bug could be fatal. It is recommended that it be fixed before release.\n[JP]\nコントローラー操作からハンドトラッキング操作に切り替えると、他の人に指の動きが同期されず、常に\"Idle\"ステートの状態になります。\nRejoinやアバター変更により、アバターを再読み込みさせると、指の動きが同期されるようになります。",
